  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### Added\n* Result ergonomics:\n  * `ProcessResult.ToString()` in bracketed diagnostic form (`[ExitCode=N, Path=..., Runtime=...]`)\n  * `BufferedProcessResult.ToString()` with output-length indicators and `Truncated=true` when truncated\n  * `BufferedProcessResult.Deconstruct(out int exitCode, out string stdout, out string stderr)`\n  * `IsExitCodeZero()` and `EnsureExitCodeZero()` extensions on `ProcessResult`\n  * Lazy `EnumerateOutputLines()` / `EnumerateErrorLines()` extensions on `BufferedProcessResult`\n* Two new guides: [results](https://alastairlundy.github.io/CliInvoke/docs/guides/results) and [stdin piping](https://alastairlundy.github.io/CliInvoke/docs/guides/stdin-piping).",
